cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying preprint."
title: "Digital Registrar"
abstract: >
  A schema-first framework for multi-cancer, privacy-preserving pathology
  abstraction via local LLMs. Implements a CAP-aligned clinical ontology as
  strictly-typed DSPy signatures spanning 10 cancer types and 193 registry
  fields.
